## Missing-Chemical Impact and Preparation

TARGET / IDEAL remains inventory-independent. CURRENT omits unavailable Ethyl Linalool and uncovered Basil, and removes unresolved Pamzest/Parmavert; owned linalool, linalyl acetate, ionone, bergamot, and lemon cover only partial functions; a subthreshold Terpinyl Acetate neat trace is intentionally omitted. Exact cedrat, white pepper, Haitian vetiver, sandalwood, Vertofix Coeur, and Hedione HC remain gaps. Verify EB; purchase only after a constant-total missing-material arm.

## Controlled Blinded Test Plan

Compare coded equal-mass, equal-concentration LH-05 and LH-01 samples in balanced order at 0, 5, and 30 minutes and 2 and 4 hours. Judge L'Homme identity before opening sparkle, bitterness, transition continuity, and liking. No physical result exists yet.

## Claim Ceiling

Physical liking, sensory similarity, stability, and measured headspace are `NOT TESTED`; safety and release are `NOT CLEARED`.

